    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d498-a5">

                <pb facs="0592" n="510" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg510"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 5.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Headquarters West Sub-district,
                                Texas, Brownsville,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 28, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">General</hi>: I am satisfied that there is an
                    organized band of robbers whose operations extend to both sides of the Rio
                    Grande, and who are in communication with the Yankees, and possibly act in
                    conjunction with them.</p>
                <p>Recent developments render the conclusion inevitable that no organization
                    connected in any manner with the government of the United States can be supposed
                    to have much regard for the interests and friendship of the imperial government
                    of Mexico, and that it is the common duty and the common interest of your
                    government and of mine to break up and disperse such organizations. I shall
                    place troops on the river for that purpose, and should be pleased to have them
                    act in concert with yours.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to renew my assurance of regard and personal consideration. Your
                    obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. S. FORD, <hi rendition="#italic">Colonel Commanding pro
                        tem.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>General Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tomas Mejia</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
